    "body": "> Which seems to indicate that `referrer.[[RequestedModules]]` will always have at minimum one element.\r\n\r\nI don't think that's true? If there is no first element of _referrer_.[[RequestedModules]], then certain _moduleRequest_ will not be equal to it, since it doesn't exist.",
